Data lake: “A scalable storage foundation for structured, semi-structured, and unstructured data.”
Data warehouse: “A platform for curated, structured data optimized for business reporting and analytical queries.”
Data lakehouse: “An architecture combining flexible lake storage with reliable table management and analytical capabilities.”
Data modeling: “The process of defining data grain, relationships, facts, dimensions, and business definitions for accurate analysis.”
Delta Lake: “A technology that adds transactional reliability, controlled updates, schema management, and historical versions to lake-based tables.”


Final memory: Lake = store. Warehouse = analyze. Lakehouse = combine capabilities. Modeling = structure. Delta Lake = reliable tables.
